matter what model you own, our <span class=\"highlight-orange text-lg\">air cooler repair services bharuch</span> have you covered.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-blue-900 shadow-md\">\n                    <h3 class=\"font-black text-blue-900 uppercase text-xs mb-3 tracking-widest\">Desert Coolers</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase\">Expertise in <span class=\"highlight-orange\">metal tank sealing</span> and heavy motor winding for high-capacity desert units.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-blue-900 shadow-md\">\n                    <h3 class=\"font-black text-blue-900 uppercase text-xs mb-3 tracking-widest\">Tower Coolers</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase\">Specializing in <span class=\"highlight-gold\">noiseless blower adjustment</span> and remote control PCB repair.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-blue-900 shadow-md\">\n                    <h3 class=\"font-black text-blue-900 uppercase text-xs mb-3 tracking-widest\">Industrial Units</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase\">Dedicated team for <span class=\"highlight-orange\">GIDC factory cooling system</span> maintenance in Dahej and Ankleshwar.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- INDUSTRIAL AREAS SECTION (BHARUCH) -->\n        <section id=\"industrial-gidc\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-900 uppercase mb-8 text-center\">GIDC and Industrial air cooler repair services bharuch</h2>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-10\">\n                Industrial environments in Bharuch and Dahej g